flowchart TB
  subgraph A[一体式]
    A1[Harness + Execution + 本地 State]
  end
  subgraph B[状态分离式]
    B1[Harness + Execution] <--> B2[持久化 State]
  end
  subgraph C[执行分离式]
    C1[Harness + State] --> C2[远程 Execution]
  end
  subgraph D[三层分离式]
    D1[Harness] <--> D2[持久化 State]
    D1 --> D3[异构 Execution]
  end
  A ~~~ B
  B ~~~ C
  C ~~~ D
